su-per hanc pé-tram aedi¬</l><l xml:id="m-1de475ec-609a-46f5-9e81-e1a5d3ec1a5c" facs="#m-147546ec-194c-4daf-92e8-3761cf7a3ff7" label="lyrics-like">fi-cábo Ecclé-si-am mé¬ am.</l><l xml:id="m-f4d9d8ec-975b-4bbf-9da9-05b9d2004f24" facs="#m-737f3d6c-19ab-49d8-9108-27ab54d89a69" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-0b286954-a2e2-46e8-9ccb-eca4b2540b0f" facs="#m-ac8f8c68-ce49-423f-a0b0-fda4b7d6158c" label="lyrics-like">Uos caelésti, Dómine, aliménto ]nibus ab omni adversitáte custódi.</l><l xml:id="m-c577f6c7-5f66-426b-92b8-c95cda1e8be3" facs="#m-3f0249aa-b6fc-434c-82d4-2ac13c362879" label="lyrics-like">U satiásti : apostólicis intercessió-]Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-2126240d-5c9a-42e6-a2cd-2f078ef296a5" facs="#m-2f72ec64-7788-40e4-8db2-f5c9dd2911a3" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-c517480c-c7d2-4148-916d-7235f5ca1d9c" facs="#m-995a4486-cbf6-4718-913a-f60b0c2da3ef" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Díxit Angelus ad Pétrum. p. 1515.</l><l xml:id="m-f1be54b8-323b-41ed-9fd3-55462fe97cc3" facs="#m-e534987c-3bd7-4d31-ad78-1b0d568b3a7c" label="ambiguous">Acts. 12.</l><l xml:id="m-4500018c-f51c-4383-95b3-3a21beddeeda" facs="#m-d28a0920-1e94-45df-a088-1445c88104c6" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-ca10fc7e-31b1-4447-bad1-e239d5ebffa7" facs="#m-9c0ea0a0-a243-4b7e-bbb6-07f28c715215" label="lyrics-like">DEtrus quidem servabátur in cár-intermissióne“ab Ecclésia ad Deum</l><l xml:id="m-a09513ac-abac-447c-97c5-97ef632903f1" facs="#m-0fd0575c-74de-4089-8d6c-bae6ede4f2ef" label="lyrics-like">Lcere. fOrátio autem fiébat sine! pro eo.</l><l xml:id="m-d9e734dc-afb9-4b64-9738-bb3884a56828" facs="#m-7a849df3-692f-4cf7-938f-fb30d29d5b18" label="ambiguous">short!</l><l xml:id="m-d8d99774-fbf8-401c-af65-9cc1420d1cd4" facs="#m-fdba3181-00fe-4794-a710-da2be71d566c" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-86298be5-b87d-4b6f-b0e9-0401a5cc5a12" facs="#m-4ba15ba6-b5ec-4d06-b926-c696dfbe3908" label="lyrics-like">Onstí-tu-es é-os príncipes “Super ómnem térram.</l><l xml:id="m-1d170ec7-234c-425c-b79d-c2395687fa0a" facs="#m-33078b13-4711-4439-a9fd-9a2b964550e0" label="lyrics-like">V. Mémores érunt nómi-nis tú-i Dómine. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-7d3216d2-c8aa-443e-83ed-9a8cf84d7333" facs="#m-1932640f-15ac-4218-9e4e-69c9e0151fb2" label="lyrics-like">V. Nimis honoráti sunt amíci túi Déus.</l><l xml:id="m-fd2cb525-000b-4768-8a4d-4f9e8b02c7d4" facs="#m-788848d9-0d6b-4278-8230-722a3a5fa4f8" label="lyrics-like">K. Nimis confortátus est principátus eórum.</l><l xml:id="m-35d7d641-9e8d-4a99-8aff-fe7611d453aa" facs="#m-c3a0e29f-6cc0-44cc-a768-83c18082655b" label="text-like">AT NONE</l><l xml:id="m-48874eb1-65ac-414a-86cd-1983d96899ab" facs="#m-cb9b897b-81d2-4e20-a394-2125e2c48147" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Tu es Pétrus. p. 1515.</l><l xml:id="m-ee51f9ba-69ab-4d13-8454-a4b9939f39b7" facs="#m-a20c0f44-859d-4159-b12a-d40983ad3809" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-a5298ed9-3fd8-4541-a695-460f01a5ab4d" facs="#m-d286b4f1-cee5-4e0c-9ffa-80a0be8643a4" label="ambiguous">Acts. 12. b.</l><l xml:id="m-060ed506-a6d9-44c1-bad9-3fcedac04fb5" facs="#m-a471df5e-fb4b-44ff-a0f0-d1ce6709a728" label="lyrics-like">T Petrus ad se revérsus, dixit :[me de manu Heródis* et de omui</l><l xml:id="m-748c654c-f202-4a84-9970-2755e68c02f5" facs="#m-7c04466e-5b5f-4559-bec2-0db5e0f506c1" label="lyrics-like">L Nunc scio vere, quia misit Dó-lexspectatióne plebis Judacórum.</l><l xml:id="m-4d7bc05d-e86f-4ee6-8cb4-1c3578143496" facs="#m-6292d52e-4b2a-4aa1-a034-404f84ad72de" label="ambiguous">minus Angelum suum, t et eripuit!</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
